Z||000000||Vlad||02-10-2001||11:28 PM||||Hello.........<P>I'm going to repaint mirrors tomorrow and they need some sandwork of course.<BR>So what sandpaper number should I use to prepare mirrors for painting?<P>Thanks||||reg||5
Z||000001||rogergarrison||02-11-2001||12:16 AM||||since i usually wet sand and rub out the cars I do, i sand with #400 before I paint. You may not need to do that on just mirrors. so id use #600 so you wont have to sand the color. You can still rub it out by hand after it cures.||||reg||1
